  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Areas v9.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Health Areas v9.0 dataset consists of health area boundaries with name, health zone, and other attributes for all the twenty-six provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD). The current version supersedes the GRID3 COD - Health Areas v8.0 < https://doi.org/10.7916/kcq9-7s03 >. The following changes were made: -The data for Haut-Lomami, Haut-Katanga, Ituri, Kwango, Lomami, Maniema and Tanganyika provinces were updated. Health area names were updated. This dataset should be considered operational; it has not been fully validated by government authorities. Keywords: Health Boundaries, Health Areas",
